[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787766761","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103894#issuecomment-2787766761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103894","id":2787766761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mKfHp","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T22:08:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T22:10:46Z","body":"I've been using this setting (with its default value of `false`) for a long while now with no issue, and the performance improvement while editing shaders with lots of includes is dramatic.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787766761/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251194403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103894#issuecomment-3251194403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103894","id":3251194403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ByUoj","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T00:18:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T00:20:28Z","body":"With https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107547 in place, would this PR still be relevant? It should decrease prints by a lot already (easily a factor of 10× to 100×), even in shaders with multiple include levels.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251194403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251372440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103894#issuecomment-3251372440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103894","id":3251372440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BzAGY","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T01:32:41Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T01:58:36Z","body":"> With #107547 in place, would this PR still be relevant? It should decrease prints by a lot already (easily a factor of 10× to 100×), even in shaders with multiple include levels.\r\n\r\nI'd still use this setting as well, because the number of non-error prints I want to see in the console is 0. The error is the only valuable part, because I'll see the details once I open the shader file.\r\n\r\nSo, ideally, I'd prefer if both were merged. Optimized output for people who want it and only errors for people (like me) who don't. But, since this indents and wraps code changed in the other PR, this may need to be rebased on top of the other after it's merged.\r\n\r\nAlso, as a reminder, this PR's setting is false (doesn't print shader contents to standard output) by default, because I believe it's the most sane option while errors are still printed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251372440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251706633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103894#issuecomment-3251706633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103894","id":3251706633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B0RsJ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T03:44:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T03:44:09Z","body":"Let's wait and see the performance impact of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107547 in practice. My guess is it will be enough that this PR won't be needed anymore. \r\n\r\nI definitely disagree with defaulting to false though. So even if we find that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107547 isn't enough, this PR will need to be changed to default to true. I am not going to force everyone to open every shader in the editor if they want to get line numbers from the debug output. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251706633/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251917786","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103894#issuecomment-3251917786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103894","id":3251917786,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B1FPa","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T05:16:46Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T05:33:26Z","body":"It's not exclusively for performance, even though that was my primary motivation. It's also the fact that there's no way to filter out those messages from the other standard output, and they're useless.\r\n\r\n> I am not going to force everyone to open every shader in the editor if they want to get line numbers from the debug output.\r\n\r\nFirst, if they have a shader error, they'll need to open the shader editor to fix it anyway. I highly doubt there are many people editing shaders outside of the editor or procedurally generating them. So, they would be the exception.\r\n\r\nSecond, this only disables the standard output. The error is still there in the console, and it provides the line number. So, the standard output printing is redundant even if you want to get the line number from the console.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251917786/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]